---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description="How Bright Picks handles data and third-party affiliate links.">
  <section class="pad">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> · Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p>Bright Picks respects your privacy. This is a simple content site — we don't ask you to create an account, and we don't collect personal information from you directly.</p>

      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>This site uses third-party affiliate links, principally to Amazon.co.uk. If you click one and buy a product, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. Amazon may set its own cookies to attribute that purchase — this is governed by Amazon's own privacy policy, not ours. See our <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for more.</p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics 4 to understand, in aggregate, which pages and links are useful — for example which product picks get clicked. Google sets cookies to measure page views and visits. We have not enabled Google's advertising features or cross-site identifiers, and the reports do not identify you personally. You can opt out with Google's <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">browser add-on</a>.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Any questions about privacy? Email <a href="mailto:brightpicks26@gmail.com">brightpicks26@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
